  13 AA 45,  64,  208, 579; COL 130; CT 478, 509; DA 250, 354; Ed 95; EW 194; FE 242,  456, 514; MB 28; MH 512; SC 75; 1T 132; 2T 343; 4T 378, 634; 5T 225, 487; 6T 47,  70,  401, 421; 8T 174, 191; 9T 146
